<title>THAILAND: Sino-Thai Engineering Q3 turns to loss.</title>
<headline>Sino-Thai Engineering Q3 turns to loss.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the first nine months ending Septemer 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>			     Third quarter</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)   loss	7.82     vs profit    3.04</p>
<p>    Net	    loss    234.57     vs profit   91.27</p>
<p>				Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)   loss	3.59     vs profit    9.35</p>
<p>    Net	    loss    107.61     vs profit  280.57</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Sino-Thai Engineering and Construction Plc, a construction and engineering firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
